%% System Overview — companion to PDF Figure 1
%% Render with: mmdc -i system-overview.mmd -o system-overview.svg

flowchart TB
    subgraph CLIENT[CLIENT — browser]
        SHELL[React Shell App<br/>owns SDK + scheduler]
        DQA[Document Q&A MFE]
        MEET[Meeting Summariser MFE]
        DQA -->|consumes SDK| SHELL
        MEET -->|consumes SDK| SHELL
    end

    subgraph AGENT[EDGE AGENT — native, user process]
        SUP[Supervisor<br/><i>launcher · monitor · restarter</i><br/>~20 MB resident]
        API[API Server<br/><i>HTTP + SSE · auth · routing</i><br/>~40 MB resident]
        WORK[Inference Worker<br/><i>model · tokenizer · NPU calls</i><br/>~6 GB resident]
        SUP -.->|spawn + heartbeat| API
        SUP -.->|spawn + heartbeat| WORK
        API -.->|jobs via named pipe / UDS| WORK
    end

    subgraph HW[HARDWARE]
        NPU[Qualcomm NPU]
        ANE[Apple Neural Engine]
        GPU[Metal GPU]
        CPU[CPU - Accelerate / DirectML]
        CLOUD[Cloud - last resort]
    end

    SHELL -->|HTTP + SSE on 127.0.0.1| API
    WORK --> NPU
    WORK --> ANE
    WORK --> GPU
    WORK --> CPU
    WORK -.->|opt-in only| CLOUD
